  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### Movie Spoiler Checker\r\n\r\nThis app displays a dynamic warning badge to advise you whether it is safe to share a movie-related post with a specific friend.\r\n\r\nIt bases it decision on two conditions:\r\n\r\n1. `finishedMovie`: Have both you and your friend already watched the movie to the end?\r\n2. `hasSpoilerTags`: Does the post itself contain potential spoilers??\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Click through the different combinations of \"Yes\" and \"No\" in the app.\r\n\r\n2. In your Unit Guide, describe the outcome of each combination of path in the flowchart and check that the code works as expected.\r\n\r\n3. Prompt AI to help you understand the nested `if/else` statements.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
